#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Assigned user will confirm the Repair, start the repair, finish the "
"repairing work and inform the Helpdesk user for the same through Chatter "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"Dodeljeni uporabnik bo potrdil popravilo, začel popravilo, zaključil "
"popravilo in o tem prek funkcionalnosti Chatter obvestil uporabnika službe "
"za pomoč uporabnikom."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Customer can <font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>raise a "
"ticket</strong></font> to Customer Care team for Repair through mail, "
"\"Submit a Ticket\" form or clicking on Chat bot button in Help page in "
"Website. Support\n"
"            Ticket will be generated in Helpdesk app."
msgstr ""
"- Stranka lahko ekipi za pomoč strankam glede popravil po <font "
"style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>pošlje zahtevek</strong></font> "
"po e-pošti, prek obrazca \"Oddaj zahtevek\" ali s klikom na gumb "
"klepetalnega bota na strani Pomoč na spletnem mestu. Zahtevek za podporo bo "
"ustvarjen v aplikaciji Helpdesk."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Helpdesk User will create Repair in draft mode and fills up Customer's "
"details in it like equipment to be repaired, warranty end date, etc."
msgstr ""
"- Uporabnik službe za pomoč uporabnikom bo ustvaril popravilo v osnutku in "
"vanj vnesel podatke o stranki, kot so oprema za popravilo, datum poteka "
"garancije itd."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Helpdesk user will confirm with the customer whether they will pick up the "
"equipment from repairing site or request to deliver the equipment to their "
"address."
msgstr ""
"- Uporabnik službe za pomoč uporabnikom bo pri stranki preveril, ali bo ta "
"opremo prevzela na mestu popravila ali zahtevala dostavo opreme na svoj "
"naslov."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- In case of delivery to customer's address, Helpdesk user will communicate "
"with the customer after delivery and take confirmation from customer about "
"equipment working and\n"
"            <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">closes the "
"Ticket</font></strong><font style=\"color: rgb(181, 214, 165);\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"- Če je dostava na naslov stranke, bo uporabnik službe za pomoč uporabnikom "
"po dostavi stopil v stik s stranko in\n"
"            <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">zapre "
"zahtevek</font></strong><font style=\"color: rgb(181, 214, 165);\">.</font>"

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- In case of pick up, ticket will be closed after customer's confirmation of "
"checking equipment at repairing site."
msgstr ""
"V primeru prevzema bo zahtevek zaprt po strankini potrditvi pregleda opreme "
"na mestu popravila."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Inventory user <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">will "
"validate</font></strong> returned equipment in Return and check the <font "
"style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>warranty end date</strong></"
"font>. If the\n"
"            warranty date is not under the warranty period, an invoice will "
"be raised for the parts replaced and repairing charge."
msgstr ""
"- Uporabnik zalog <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">bo "
"potrdil</font></strong> vrnjeno opremo v razdelku Vračilo in preveril <font "
"style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>končni datum garancije</strong></"
"font>. Če je\n"
"            datum garancije zunaj garancijskega obdobja, bo izdan račun za "
"zamenjane dele in strošek popravila."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid "- Warranty end date is fetched from delivery of the equipment."
msgstr "- Datum konca garancije se pridobi iz dostave opreme."

