#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>CRM App</b>: Capture leads from your website and track them through the "
"sales funnel, managing site visits\n"
"                and technical feasibility checks."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija CRM</b>: Zajemajte potencialne stranke s svojega spletnega "
"mesta in jih spremljajte skozi prodajni lijak ter upravljajte obiske na "
"lokaciji\n"
"                in preverjanja tehnične izvedljivosti."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Field Service App</b>: Schedule your installation crews and maintenance "
"teams efficiently, allowing them to\n"
"                log time and consume parts via mobile."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija za storitve na terenu</b>: Učinkovito razporedite svoje ekipe "
"za namestitev in vzdrževanje ter jim omogočite, da prek mobilnih naprav\n"
"                beležijo čas in porabljajo dele."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory App</b>: Keep track of high-value stock like solar modules and "
"batteries, ensuring you have the\n"
"                right components for every job."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija Inventar</b>: Spremljajte zalogo visoke vrednosti, kot so "
"solarni moduli in baterije, ter poskrbite, da imate\n"
"                prave komponente za vsako opravilo."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Project App</b>: Manage installation projects with clear stages (e.g., "
"\"Permitting,\" \"Installation,\"\n"
"                \"Inspection\"), tracking tasks and deadlines."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija Projekti</b>: Upravljajte namestitvene projekte z jasnimi "
"fazami (npr. \"Pridobivanje dovoljenj,\" \"Namestitev,\"\n"
"                \"Inšpekcijski pregled\"), spremljajte opravila in roke."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Sales App</b>: Create professional, detailed proposals that include "
"technical specifications for panels,\n"
"                inverters, and labor costs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prodajna aplikacija</b>: Ustvarite profesionalne, podrobne ponudbe, ki "
"vključujejo tehnične specifikacije za panele,\n"
"                razsmernike in stroške dela."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Sign App</b>: Securely collect digital signatures for contracts, "
"interconnection agreements, and financing\n"
"                documents."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aplikacija za podpisovanje</b>: Varno zbirajte digitalne podpise za "
"pogodbe, sporazume o medsebojnem povezovanju in finančne\n"
"                dokumente."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Website App</b>: Showcase your portfolio of successful installations and "
"attract new eco-conscious clients\n"
"                with a professional online presence."
msgstr ""
"<b>Spletna aplikacija</b>: Predstavite svoj portfelj uspešnih namestitev in "
"pritegnite nove okoljsko ozaveščene stranke\n"
"                s profesionalno spletno prisotnostjo."

